AI Video Studio is made of two parts, under two licences:

  PART A  The original project "hyperframes-ai-video-generation" by Cole Medin
          (https://github.com/coleam00/hyperframes-ai-video-generation), up to and
          including its commit 5900f01. Licensed under the MIT License (below).

  PART B  Everything added or changed in AI Video Studio after that commit
          ("the Additions"), for example PLAYBOOK.md, SETUP.md, AGENTS.md, brand/,
          tools/, the Gemini TTS and sound-effect scripts and the changes to
          README.md and CLAUDE.md. Licensed under the AI Video Studio Community
          License (below).

Where a file contains both, Part A covers the original material and Part B covers
the Additions. Third-party components keep their own licences (for example
HyperFrames, GSAP, Kokoro, Noto fonts under the SIL Open Font License, and any
model or service you connect).

