A note from the Author, in plain words: I built AI Video Studio so that anyone
can make good videos without a big budget. Use it, learn from it, test it and
improve it - for free. If it helps you earn money, I only ask two things: tell
me, and share 10% of the profit it helps you make. That keeps the project alive
and lets me keep improving it for everyone. The binding terms are below.

1. DEFINITIONS

   "Software" means the Additions described in Part B, in source or any other
   form, including the documentation, prompts, rules and know-how written in
   them, and any work that copies, adapts or is derived from them.

   "Commercial Use" means any use of the Software, or of videos or other output
   made with it, that is intended for or results in money or other commercial
   advantage. This includes: selling or licensing videos made with the Software;
   offering video production or a paid service, product or app that uses the
   Software; and using videos made with the Software to advertise or promote a
   business, product or service.

   "Non-Commercial Use" means personal use, learning, teaching, research,
   testing and evaluation, and use by registered non-profit organisations for
   their non-profit work, where nobody earns money from the use or its output.

   "Net Profit" means the revenue you receive that is attributable to your
   Commercial Use, minus the direct costs of earning that revenue (for example
   paid AI services, footage, advertising spend and payment fees), calculated
   in good faith. Where revenue cannot be directly attributed (for example
   general business promotion), you and the Author will agree a fair estimate
   in good faith.

2. FREE NON-COMMERCIAL USE

