3. COMMERCIAL USE

   You may make Commercial Use of the Software on these conditions:

   a) Notice. Within 30 days of your first Commercial Use, notify the Author by
      opening an issue titled "Commercial use" in the AI Video Studio GitHub
      repository, or by any other means that reliably reaches the Author
      through https://github.com/rifatshahrukh-dev. Include your name or
      company name and a short description of the use. You may ask for any
      private details to be exchanged by email or another private channel.

   b) Profit share. Pay the Author 10% (ten percent) of your Net Profit from
      Commercial Use, at least once every 12 months, together with a short
      statement of how it was calculated. The Author may ask for reasonable
      supporting information.

   c) Other arrangements. The Author and you may agree different terms (for
      example a fixed fee, a different percentage, or a waiver) in writing,
      including by email. A written agreement replaces 3(b) for the use it
      covers.

   If the Net Profit for a 12-month period is zero or negative, nothing is
   owed for that period, but the notice in 3(a) is still required.

